cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DYNAMITE in your research, please cite both the software (this
  record, which points to the archived release) and the accompanying article.
title: "DYNAMITE: DYNAmical Mean-fIeld Time Evolution solver"
abstract: >-
  High-performance C++/CUDA framework for the long-time numerical solution of
  two-time dynamical mean-field equations (DMFE), based on a fixed non-uniform
  grid in the ratio theta = t'/t, high-order interpolation with precomputed
  stencils, adaptive Runge-Kutta time stepping and controlled sparsification of
  the stored history.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/DMFT-evolution/DYNAMITE"
url: "https://dmft-evolution.github.io/DYNAMITE/"
version: 1.4.0.0
date-released: 2026-26-10
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - dynamical mean-field equations
  - spin glasses
  - aging dynamics
  - GPU computing
  - C++
  - CUDA
